flowchart TD
    Input[Caller turn] --> Safety{Predefined safety match?}
    Safety -->|Yes| Help[Human request; truthful availability]
    Safety -->|No| Kind{Public information or patient action?}
    Kind -->|Public| Read[Catalog or grounded RAG tool]
    Kind -->|Patient| Session{Backend verified binding?}
    Session -->|No| Verify[Direct browser OTP or registration]
    Verify --> Input
    Session -->|Yes| Proposal[propose_* immutable summary]
    Proposal --> Delivered{Summary delivered and new caller turn?}
    Delivered -->|No| Wait[Await delivery and answer]
    Delivered -->|Yes| Consent{Caller affirmative?}
    Consent -->|No or ambiguous| Clarify[Decline or clarify without mutation]
    Consent -->|Yes| Confirm[confirm_pending_action; session and proposal checks]
    Confirm --> Backend[Backend auth, ownership, idempotency and transaction]
    Backend --> Result{Actual outcome}
    Result -->|Success| Speak[Report verified result]
    Result -->|Definite failure| Failure[Explain; new proposal needs new consent]
    Result -->|Timeout| Reconcile[Same immutable payload and key]
    Reconcile --> Backend
